          TypeScript • 6 min
        </div>
        <h4
          class="font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors mb-2"
        >
          Advanced Generics in TS
        </h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 line-clamp-2">
          Level up your type safety with these complex generic patterns...
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Recent Post 2 -->
    <div class="glass bento-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
      <div
        class="h-40 bg-cover bg-center"
        data-alt="Retro computer aesthetic with cyan lighting"
        style='
              background-image: url("https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBiCMm96iwlXhEdUppd1DZ2-0OWSkEhuoIUmxZehpN0kLUipylq9RTHM7cZkm9chA_etueAHcuDLkpWcqtjHX96rgerE2vBCWozN6mol0t1b1c_9zUDZPTeYZNw08h7kJhiK-mujhJaMM0wXXLdBt1sXxcagyHTUjQw7Ukpruv2XbLJ2l-JGl-Tv4McFPw6g62wgYGSoXtaiuwKdZxRoFRwmCz6LyKtTI49gSn2Mv6UfK-qnUtrC7sw44_-1ybqru7rqyrk0MyjRqQ");
            '
      >
      </div>
      <div class="p-5">
        <div
          class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide font-bold"
        >
          UI/UX • 8 min
        </div>
        <h4
          class="font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors mb-2"
        >
          Bento Grids: The New Trend
        </h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 line-clamp-2">
          Why modern documentation is moving away from linear layouts...
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Recent Post 3 -->
    <div class="glass bento-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
      <div
        class="h-40 bg-cover bg-center"
        data-alt="Programmer working late at night with neon lights"
        style='
              background-image: url("https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDN1iVpA1DdwYqIlq5FsWtM5d0Mk37qqmLh9gp-3XKEpr3I2VSe00owyrfOD33ZbKvu6gDcz_eZ-altNRGROUBzQ0bCXVxsc_WWCacj9zJVzxCp3icjjBkGcl2n1glOD0apv4yhDWeUULvTCD6cbl6cU8ZH1EWz9zG-jFNM06uUgKwzE53bujuf0G89NV9yEa3cSC2fRbetR41WSNQZbChZPFZRkrBRftZmvLVig7EH9REfUihk4hvTt7S1zp46cfrJKwGdPK6IVPY");
            '
      >
      </div>
      <div class="p-5">
        <div
          class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide font-bold"
        >
          Performance • 5 min
        </div>
        <h4
          class="font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors mb-2"
        >
          Edge Computing 101
        </h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 line-clamp-2">
          Deploying your logic closer to your users for zero latency...
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Stats/Socials Mini Tile -->
    <div
      class="glass bento-card rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-center text-center"
    >
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="p-3 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400">12k</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">
            Readers
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400">45+</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">
            Articles
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 flex justify-around text-slate-400">
        <span
          class="material-symbols-outlined hover:text-cyan-400 cursor-pointer"
          >public</span
        >
        <span
          class="material-symbols-outlined hover:text-cyan-400 cursor-pointer"
          >share</span
        >
        <span
          class="material-symbols-outlined hover:text-cyan-400 cursor-pointer"
          >alternate_email</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Pagination / Footer -->
  <div
    class="mt-16 flex items-center justify-between py-8 border-t border-white/5"
  >
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
      © 2023 DevPortfolio. Built with React &amp; Tailwind.
    </p>
    <div class="flex gap-2">
      <button
        class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-slate-400 transition-all"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">chevron_left</span>
      </button>
      <button
        class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-cyan-400 text-neutral-950 font-bold"
      >
        1
      </button>
      <button
        class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-slate-400 transition-all"
      >
        2
      </button>
      <button
        class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-slate-400 transition-all"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">chevron_right</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
